OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACare home nurse dragged patient to
OL,4,Afloor, cutting his head
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nurse pulled a vulnerable resident at
OL,7,Fa care home for people with mental
OL,8,Fhealth conditions to the ground causing
OL,9,Fhim to cut his head, a misconduct panel
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FDavid Guyers, who worked at
OL,13,FSwallowfield Garden Care Home in
OL,14,FBolton, also lied in an incident report
OL,15,Fin which he described the man as
OL,16,Fsustaining a "witnessed fall".
OL,18,FAn independent panel heard Guyers
OL,19,Fclaimed the man, referred to as
OL,20,FResident A, had been "trashing the
OL,21,Fkitchen" and that he tried to take hold
OL,22,Fof his hands to remove him.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
