OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Guyers was struck off after
OL,7,Fthe Nursing and Midwifery Council (NMC)
OL,8,Fwatchdog reviewed CCTV footage
OL,9,Fconfirming Resident A's behaviour
OL,10,F"appeared to give no cause for
OL,11,Fconcern".
